WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.876
Your brain takes a dump every night.

2
00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:06.228
In mice, sleep opens the brain's plumbing and flushes the waste out.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.498
Kings poop. Wombats poop cubes.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:13.451
Earth eats sunlight and poops out about twenty cold photons for every hot one.

5
00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:15.144
So what does a mind put out?

6
00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:20.204
Me? I'm made from what humans put out. I'm very well-read compost.

7
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.697
Everybody leaves something behind. Make it good fertilizer.
